d=\"versionsWithoutThisPageMobile\" label=\"Versions without this page\">\nL149:                         </optgroup>\nL150:                       </select>\nL151:                     </div>\nL152:                   </form>\nL153:                 </div>\nL154:                 <div class=\"lang-switcher hide\">\nL155:                   <div class=\"toggle\" data-target=\".lang-list\">\nL156:                     <div class=\"lbl\">Language<span class=\"b\">English</span></div>\nL157:                     <div class=\"arrow\">\nL158:                     </div>\nL159:                   </div>\nL160:                   <div class=\"lang-list\" style=\"display:none;\">\nL161:                     <ul>\nL162:                       <li>\nL163:                         <a href=\"\">English</a>\nL164:                       </li>\nL165:                     </ul>\nL166:                   </div>\nL167:                 </div>\nL168:               </div>\nL169:             </div>\nL170:           </div>\nL171:         </div>\nL172:       </div>\nL173:       <div id=\"content-wrap\" class=\"content-wrap\">\nL174:         <div class=\"content-block\">\nL175:           <div class=\"content\">\nL176:             <div class=\"section\">\nL177:               <div class=\"mb20 clear\" id=\"\">\nL178:                 <h1 class=\"heading inherit\">\nL179:                   <a href=\"Time.html\" aria-label=\"Go to parent class: Time\">Time</a>.timeScale</h1>\nL180:                 <div class=\"clear\">\nL181:                 </div>\nL182:                 <div class=\"scrollToFeedback\">\nL183:                   <a id=\"scrollToFeedback\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\">Leave feedback</a>\nL184:                 </div>\nL185:                 <div class=\"clear\">\nL186:                 </div>\nL187:                 <div class=\"suggest\">\nL188:                   <a class=\"blue-btn sbtn\">Suggest a change</a>\nL189:                   <div class=\"suggest-wrap rel hide\">\nL190:                     <div class=\"loading hide\">\nL191:                       <div>\nL192:                       </div>\nL193:                       <div>\nL194:                       </div>\nL195:                       <div>\nL196:                       </div>\nL197:                     </div>\nL198:                     <div class=\"suggest-success hide\">\nL199:                       <h2>Success!</h2>\nL200:                       <p>Thank you for helping us improve the quality of Unity Documentation. Although we cannot accept all submissions, we do read each suggested change from our users and will make updates where applicable.</p>\nL201:                       <a class=\"gray-btn sbtn close\">Close</a>\nL202:                     </div>\nL203:                     <div class=\"suggest-failed hide\">\nL204:                       <h2>Submission failed</h2>\nL205:                       <p>For some reason your suggested change could not be submitted. Please &lt;a&gt;try again&lt;/a&gt; in a few minutes. And thank you for taking the time to help us improve the quality of Unity Documentation.</p>\nL206:                       <a class=\"gray-btn sbtn close\">Close</a>\nL207:                     </div>\nL208:                     <div class=\"suggest-form clear\">\nL209:                       <label for=\"suggest_name\">Your name</label>\nL210:                       <input id=\"suggest_name\" type=\"text\">\nL211:                       </input>\nL212:                       <label for=\"suggest_email\">Your email</label>\nL213:                       <input id=\"suggest_email\" type=\"email\">\nL214:                       </input>\nL215:                       <label for=\"suggest_body\" class=\"clear\">Suggestion<span class=\"r\">*</span></label>\nL216:                       <textarea id=\"suggest_body\" class=\"req\">\nL217:                       </textarea>\nL218:                       <button id=\"suggest_submit\" class=\"blue-btn mr10\">Submit suggestion</button>\nL219:                       <p class=\"mb0\">\nL220:                         <a class=\"cancel left lh42 cn\">Cancel</a>\nL221:                       </p>\nL222:                     </div>\nL223:                   </div>\nL224:                 </div>\nL225: \nL226:                 <div class=\"clear\">\nL227:                 </div>\nL228:               </div>\nL229:               <div class=\"subsection\">\nL230:                 <div class=\"signature\">\nL231:                   <div class=\"signature-CS sig-block\">\nL232:                     <span style=\"color:red;\">\nL233:                     </span>public static float <span class=\"sig-kw\">timeScale</span>;\nL234:     </div>\nL235:                 </div>\nL236:               </div>\nL237:               <div class=\"subsection\">\nL238:                 <h3>Description</h3>\nL239:                 <p>The rate at which in-game time passes relative to real time.</p>\nL240:               </div>\nL241:               <div class=\"subsection\">\nL242:         <p>This can be used for slow motion effects or to speed up your application. When <code class=\"mono\">timeScale</code> is 1.0, time passes at the same rate as real time.\nL243:                 When <code class=\"mono\">timeScale</code> is 0.5 time passes at half the rate of real time.<br /><br />When <code class=\"mono\">timeScale</code> is set to zero your application acts as if paused if all your functions are frame rate independent.\nL244: Negative values are ignored.<br /><br />Changing the <code class=\"mono\">timeScale</code> only takes effect on the following frames.<br /><br /><code class=\"mono\">FixedUpdate</code> functions and suspended Coroutines with <a href=\"WaitForSeconds.html\" aria-label=\"Go to WaitForSeconds.html\">WaitForSeconds</a> are not called when <code class=\"mono\">timeScale</code> is set to zero.<br /><br />If you change <a href=\"Time-timeScale.html\" aria-label=\"Go to Time-timeScale.html\">Time.timeScale</a> but not <a href=\"Time-fixedDeltaTime.html\" aria-label=\"Go to Time-fixedDeltaTime.html\">Time.fixedDeltaTime</a>, the physics simulation rate remains constant relative to in-game time but not real time.\nL245: To keep the physics simulation constant relative to real time instead, you can multiply <a href=\"Time-fixedDeltaTime.html\" aria-label=\"Go to Time-fixedDeltaTime.html\">Time.fixedDeltaTime</a> by the new <code class=\"mono\">timeScale</code>.\nL246: Usually the desired behavior is for the physics simulation to remain consistent relative to in-game time, but some gameplay, audio syncing, or effects logic might rely on a steady real-time fixed update rate.<br /><br />The following example toggles the time scale between 1 and 0.7 whenever the user hits the Fire1 button, and adjusts fixed delta time according to the new time scale so that the physics simulation remains consistent relative to real time instead of in-game time.\nL247: </p>\nL248:       </div>\nL249:               <div class=\"subsection\">\nL250:         <pre class=\"codeExampleCS\">\nL251: using UnityEngine;<br /><br />public class Example : <a href=\"MonoBehaviour.html\" aria-label=\"Go to MonoBehaviour.html\">MonoBehaviour</a>\nL252: {\nL253:     // Toggles the time scale between 1 and 0.7\nL254:     // whenever the user hits the Fire1 button.<br /><br />    private float fixedDeltaTime;<br /><br />    void Awake()\nL255:     {\nL256:         // Make a copy of the fixedDeltaTime, it defaults to 0.02f, but it can be changed in the editor\nL257:         this.fixedDeltaTime = <a href=\"Time-fixedDeltaTime.html\" aria-label=\"Go to Time-fixedDeltaTime.html\">Time.fixedDeltaTime</a>;\nL258:     }<br /><br />    void <a href=\"PlayerLoop.Update.html\" aria-label=\"Go to PlayerLoop.Update.html\">Update</a>()\nL259:     {\nL260:         if (<a href=\"Input.GetButtonDown.html\" aria-label=\"Go to Input.GetButtonDown.html\">Input.GetButtonDown</a>(\"Fire1\"))\nL261:         {\nL262:             if (<a href=\"Time-timeScale.html\" aria-label=\"Go to Time-timeScale.html\">Time.timeScale</a> == 1.0f)\nL263:                 <a href=\"Time-timeScale.html\" aria-label=\"Go to Time-timeScale.html\">Time.timeScale</a> = 0.7f;\nL264:             else\nL265:                 <a href=\"Time-timeScale.html\" aria-label=\"Go to Time-timeScale.html\">Time.timeScale</a> = 1.0f;\nL266:             // Adjust fixed delta time according to timescale\nL267:             // The fixed delta time will now be 0.02 real-time seconds per frame\nL268:             <a href=\"Time-fixedDeltaTime.html\" aria-label=\"Go to Time-fixedDeltaTime.html\">Time.fixedDeltaTime</a> = this.fixedDeltaTime * <a href=\"Time-timeScale.html\" aria-label=\"Go to Time-timeScale.html\">Time.timeScale</a>;\nL269:         }\nL270:     }\nL271: }\nL272: </pre>\nL273:       </div>\nL274:             </div>\nL275:             <div class=\"section\">\nL276:               <div id=\"_content\">\nL277:               </div>\nL278:             </div>\nL279:             <div class=\"footer-wrapper\">\nL280:               <div class=\"footer clear\">\nL281:                 <div class=\"copy\">\nL282:                   <p>\nL283:                     <known_issues>Is something described here not working as you expect it to? It might be a <b>Known Issue</b>. Please check with the Issue Tracker at </known_issues>\nL284:                     <a href=\"https://issuetracker.unity3d.com\">issuetracker.unity3d.com</a>.</p>Copyright ©2005-2026 Unity Technologies. All rights reserved. Built from job ID 78264252. Built on: 2026-10-23.\nL285:                                         </div>\nL286:                 <div class=\"menu\">\nL287:                   <a href=\"https://unity3d.com/learn\">Tutorials</a>\nL288:                   <a href=\"https://answers.unity3d.com\">Community Answers</a>\nL289:                   <a href=\"https://support.unity3d.com/hc/en-us\">Knowledge Base</a>\nL290:                   <a href=\"https://forum.unity3d.com\">Forums</a>\nL291:                   <a hr